  "title": "Anomalies on the display",
  "content": "<p>Hi. I built the PCB myself at home. While working, I noticed strange anomalies in the image. The anomalies are in different places and on different photos. I asked AI but didn't get a satisfactory answer. I tried reducing the frequency without any positive effect. I suspect ESD or power supply issues. The traces are very thin, 0.4 mm for power and 0.35 mm for data. Has anyone experienced this?</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/b01b84cb-74a1-4d16-a75e-064231d57ec2.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/5c375c9b-71bb-406f-a0bb-944d24a22c28.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/1ab39a1c-58c8-4931-81da-cac5b12494a7.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/7cca2734-add9-4a9d-ad0d-e05705bf75c3.jpg\" /></figure><p> </p>",
